// FAQ data
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "Is a standing desk worth it for remote work?",
    answer:
      '<p>Yeah. Standing desks are worth the investment for remote workers. <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/topics/ergonomics/default.html" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">Research from CDC/NIOSH shows alternating between sitting and standing can reduce musculoskeletal discomfort and improve perceived energy levels</a> according to workplace ergonomics studies. If you work from home 8 plus hours daily, a standing desk helps break up sedentary time.</p><p>The key is variety. Standing all day isn\'t better than sitting all day. Best approach is switching positions every 30-60 minutes. A quality standing desk makes this effortless with one-touch preset buttons.</p>',
